; c16-4t-guarded-second. Anchor: shot-0232 (Ch. 16, four trumps).
; Printed: 0.37 (10 of 27 placements).
; Claim: with four trumps, the double among them but not the second-highest,
;   an opponent holds that trump with another trump beside it, so it survives
;   the double.
; State: the bidder's seven tiles, nothing played; the 21 others dealt
;   uniformly, seven to each other seat.
; Exact: 33/95. Book model (each missing trump in any of three hands): 10/27.
;
; t is the highest trump in a hidden hand; x is an opponent holding it and
; another trump.
(query (roles (chair v) (chair x) (domino t) (domino o))
  (out)
  (pattern
    (viewer v)
    (opponent v x)
    (in t q*)
    (in o q*)
    (none (roles (domino u) (chair y)) (in u q*) (beats u t q*) (not (viewer y)) (holds y u))
    (holds x t)
    (holds x o)))
